<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IP blockiert – Teutonia</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            max-width: 500px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .success-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            color: #27ae60;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #27ae60;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }
        .ip-address {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        p {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .note {
            background: #e8f5e9;
            border-left: 4px solid #27ae60;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #2e7d32;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
        <h1>IP blockiert</h1>
        <p>{{ message }}</p>
        <div class="ip-address">{{ ip }}</div>
        <div class="note">
            <strong>Hinweis:</strong> Die IP-Adresse wurde blockiert und erhält bei weiteren Zugriffsversuchen eine HTTP 403 Fehlermeldung.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
